<GameData>

    <Language_en_US>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS">
            <Text>Squads</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_TITLE">
            <Text>Squads for VP</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MANAGE_SQUAD">
            <Text>Manage Squad</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MOVE_SQUAD">
            <Text>Move Squad</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_RESET_SQUAD">
            <Text>Reset Squad</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_NAME">
            <Text>Squad Name</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_OPTIONS">
            <Text>Options</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_OPTION_HIGHLIGHT">
            <Text>Highlight Squad Units</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_OPTION_FLAGS_NUMBER">
            <Text>Display Squad Number on Unit Flags</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_OPTION_ESCORT">
            <Text>Escort non-combat units</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_OPTION_ESCORT_TT">
            <Text>During squad movement, combat units that start on the same tile as non combat units will escort them, linking their movement until the destination is reached or another move order is issued.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MOVEMENT_END_TYPE">
            <Text>Squad Movement End Behavior:</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MOVEMENT_END_TYPE_ALERT_ON_ARRIVAL">
            <Text>Alert on Arrival</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MOVEMENT_END_TYPE_WAKE_ON_UNIT_ARRIVAL">
            <Text>Wake on Each Unit Arrival</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MOVEMENT_END_TYPE_WAKE_ON_SQUAD_ARRIVAL">
            <Text>Wake on Squad Arrival</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_TT_MANAGE_SQUAD">
            <Text>Enter management mode, where units can be added or removed with [COLOR_YELLOW]LCLICK[ENDCOLOR] on the unit or their flag. Groups of units can be added to a squad at once by holding [COLOR_YELLOW]RCLICK[ENDCOLOR] and dragging a box over units to be added. Management mode can also be entered using the key combination [COLOR_YELLOW]CTRL+NUM[ENDCOLOR] where num is the squad number key.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_TT_MOVE_SQUAD">
            <Text>Enter movement mode, where [COLOR_YELLOW]RCLICK[ENDCOLOR] on a plot will issue move orders to all units in that squad to move to that area. Movement mode can also be entered for a squad by double tapping the number key corresponding to a squad.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_TT_RESET_SQUAD">
            <Text>Remove all units from this squad. Units can be removed individually from this squad with [COLOR_YELLOW]RCLICK[ENDCOLOR] on the unit list.</Text>
        </Row>
    </Language_en_US>
    <Language_zh_CN>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS">
            <Text>小队</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_TITLE">
            <Text>VP 小队</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MANAGE_SQUAD">
            <Text>管理小队</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MOVE_SQUAD">
            <Text>移动小队</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_RESET_SQUAD">
            <Text>重置小队</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_NAME">
            <Text>小队名称</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_OPTIONS">
            <Text>选项</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_OPTION_HIGHLIGHT">
            <Text>高亮小队单位</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_OPTION_FLAGS_NUMBER">
            <Text>在单位旗帜上显示小队编号</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_OPTION_ESCORT">
            <Text>护送非战斗单位</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_OPTION_ESCORT_TT">
            <Text>在小队移动期间，起始与非战斗单位同一地块的战斗单位会护送它们，绑定移动直到到达目的地或下达另一个移动指令。</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MOVEMENT_END_TYPE">
            <Text>小队移动结束行为：</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MOVEMENT_END_TYPE_ALERT_ON_ARRIVAL">
            <Text>抵达时提醒</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MOVEMENT_END_TYPE_WAKE_ON_UNIT_ARRIVAL">
            <Text>每个单位抵达时唤醒</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_MOVEMENT_END_TYPE_WAKE_ON_SQUAD_ARRIVAL">
            <Text>小队抵达时唤醒</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_TT_MANAGE_SQUAD">
            <Text>进入管理模式，可用 [COLOR_YELLOW]LCLICK[ENDCOLOR] 点击单位或其旗帜来添加或移除。按住 [COLOR_YELLOW]RCLICK[ENDCOLOR] 并拖拽框选可一次性将一组单位加入小队。也可使用组合键 [COLOR_YELLOW]CTRL+NUM[ENDCOLOR] 进入管理模式，其中 NUM 为小队编号键。</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_TT_MOVE_SQUAD">
            <Text>进入移动模式，在地块上 [COLOR_YELLOW]RCLICK[ENDCOLOR] 会向该小队所有单位下达移动指令。也可以通过双击对应小队的数字键来进入移动模式。</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_SQUADS_TT_RESET_SQUAD">
            <Text>从该小队中移除所有单位。可在单位列表上用 [COLOR_YELLOW]RCLICK[ENDCOLOR] 单独移除单位。</Text>
        </Row>
    </Language_zh_CN>
  
</GameData>
